"""Grade 9 Hindi — Cambridge IGCSE Hindi as a Second Language (0549) style, year 1 of 2.

Ten theme units. Reading items use original passages (profiles, articles, brochures, timetables);
listening-style items are written as transcripts (बातचीत, घोषणा, साक्षात्कार, रेडियो कार्यक्रम) of
original dialogues; grammar and vocabulary are tested in context; writing tasks follow the 0549 forms
(ई-मेल, लेख, रिपोर्ट, ब्लॉग, अनुच्छेद) with level-based Hindi mark schemes. All text is original and in Hindi.

The template factories and grammar banks live in g8_hindi.py; this file adds the 0549 skill factories
(शीर्षक मिलाना, नोट्स, सारांश) and the unit content. g10_hindi.py reuses both.
"""
